{"The guard method `include_website_name` is missing the `?` suffix. Without the `?`, ActiveModel::Serializers will not recognize this as a guard method, so it will never be called \u2014 `website_name` will always be serialized whenever `website` is present, making this method dead code.": 0.170061856508255, "`website_name` is added to the main `attributes` list but not to `untrusted_attributes`, unlike `website` which is protected there. For TL0 users viewed by anonymous visitors, `scope.restrict_user_fields?` suppresses `website` via its `include_website?` guard \u2014 but `website_name` has no such protection, so it would leak the user's website information to anonymous viewers for TL0 users.": 0.7000210285186768}